{"answer_text":"Connecting support to your CRM means agents see deal and account context on every ticket. Options that do this well: [1]\n\n- **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting. [2]\n- **Northwind CRM**: Its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices. [3]\n- **Calmline**: A calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars. [4]\n- **Orbitly**: Teams use its forms and boards as a basic request tracker. [5]\n\nIn short, Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Northwind CRM is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ec-77dd-a707-e2405b8155cb","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:47.450Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["help desk with crm sync","support software account context"],"latency_ms":5350,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[126,136],[489,499]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[222,235],[537,550]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[315,323]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"P